00:59:55.650 --> 00:59:59.480
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Mr. Torey Malatia, who says--

00:59:59.480 --> 01:00:02.620
<v Howard Stern>The government is closing in on me.

01:00:02.620 --> 01:00:10.820
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.

01:00:10.820 --> 01:00:15.820
